      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 3 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Southwest Monsoon (Habagat)\nIssued at: 5:00 AM, 03 July 2025(Thursday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Metro Manila, Bataan, Cavite, Rizal, Bulacan, Zambales and Batangas(Nasugbu, Lian, Tuy, Calatagan, Balayan).\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate with occasional heavy rains over Laguna, Quezon, and Nueva Ecija within the next 3 hours.\n\nLight to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Pampanga, Tarlac, and the rest of Batangas which may persist within 3 hours.\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 8:00 AM today.\n\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZISbP.",
